SUMMARY:Business Leaders' Evening: Your AI\, your data\, under your roof
LOCATION:LeBooster Genève\, Route de Jussy 35 (2nd floor)\, Thônex (Genev
 a)
DESCRIPTION:A French-language evening for SME leaders on getting value from
  AI without giving up control of the data: three levels of sovereign AI\, 
 a live demo of a fully offline model answering on a sample company’s doc
 uments with per-employee permissions\, what the revised Swiss data protect
 ion act expects of management\, and a networking apéro.\n\nOrganiser: ABA
 XINFO / AXION / Keeping Life Simple\, hosted by CCI France Suisse\n\nDetai
 ls and registration: https://swissdataevents.ch/events/business-leaders-ev
 ening-your-ai-your-data-geneva-2026/
